  effectSummeryList:
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - Slide faster and with less friction.
  - '-'
  - Sprint in the air to Propell yourself forward.
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - Bullets are affected by gravity.
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - 'Randomly rerolls your mutated items into an other mutated item.. '
  - '-'
  - Weapon becomes a charge shot. Buffing variable stats the longer you charge, up
    to a cap.
  - Periodicly gain a random stat buff, with a small chance of getting a debuff instead.
  - Taking damage causes an explosion, with a chance to cause another explosion.
  - Execute enemies below 5% HP.
  - Gain a stacking speed and jump boost after you land.
  - Bullets have a 25% chance to do 15% of enimes current hp as damage
  - Effect locks in on pick up.
  - When above 80% HP, Passive healing damages you.
  - Every minute convert a random common item into a mutated item.
  - Fire an additional bullet when you shoot, another additonal bullet is then shoot
    from where the bullets hit.
  - 
  - 
  - Bullets have a chance to jam enemy ranged projectile users, meaning their next
    shot will be canceled.
  - Your pants have fallen. Reloading allows you to pull them back up, temporarily
    increaseing your speed.
  - Your health drains at a constant rate. Killing an enemy turns this drain into
    healing at a faster rate while buffing your attack speed and movement speed.
  - '-'
  - '-'
  - Periodicly load bullets directly into your magazine.
  - On hit chance to ignite enemies.
  - 
